// Antivirus 95 maze: 31 rows of 28 columns, one line per row.
//   #  wall               .  pellet            o  infected disk
//   =  firewall door      P  the virus's start  (space) floor, no pellet
// A row open at both ends is a wrap-around tunnel. Keep the quarantine in the
// middle — two chambers split by a server core, each with a firewall door in
// its side wall — and the ring of floor around it, exactly as they are.
// Levels play in file-name order, then start over.
name: TWIN GATES

